++# Self-Review — Issue #908 (/shape-slice gets an edit path) — round 4, after the review of PR #911 and its F-04 leftover
++
++Rules source: `~/.phoenix/core/memory/standards/rules/self-review.md` (base, not a project override). Taken from `resolved-rules.json`; not resolved again.
++
++Diff reviewed: `git diff plan/788/798-shape-eval...HEAD` (the pull request goes to `plan/788/798-shape-eval`, not main). Rounds 3 and 4 read the three new commits line by line: `ff03da45` (ADR 058 and its index line), `d5721659` (the fixes for the ten review defects) and `ed9e2b97` (the check that finishes defect F-04). I checked each defect in `.garura/project/issues/908/review/findings.yaml` against the code, not against the commit message.
