+#908 — /shape-slice --edit: a person changes the slice record or an entry of its hidden file (business intent #904).
+Add an edit path to /shape-slice, through its ICE and /edit-play: `/shape-slice #<id> --edit: <edit instructions>`, in the person's own words. The slice skill writes the exact list of what changes (file, part, old text, new text); the brief shows each changed line old and new and names each record made out of date; nothing is written before the person's yes; a script applies only the list and a check refuses any other change; the record keeps a history line. The edit path skips the shaping steps. Remove the --redraft option (commit d756e304 of #798), which was built outside the play's ICE (PR #900 round 3, raised to P1).
