+- id: F-03
+  severity: P3
+  category: harness
+  title: One failure clause of F20 (a kept hidden-file entry changed with no approved edit) has no eval
+  where: core/components/plays/shape-slice/reference/ice.md lines 98 and 198-201 (C15 amended, F20 third clause);
+    core/components/plays/shape-slice/SKILL.md lines 809-813 (SE-26) and 884-889 (SE-27), and SCE-11
+  basis: 'Principle G11 (harness-standard.md lines 60-66): the check for a change exists and covers it. The play''s
