+- id: F-04
+  severity: P3
+  category: harness
+  title: The skill is told to say what an eval scenario says, but it may read only the eval file names
+  where: 'core/components/skills/author-slice/SKILL.md line 35 (evals: ''names only; never read them''), lines 125-127
+    (out of date: ''an eval scenario that tests a who fixes line you changed'') and lines 161-170 (example reason
